 *   1c. K   -&gt;   C
 *   1d. PH  -&gt;   FF
 *   1e. PF  -&gt;   FF
 *   1f. SCH -&gt;   SSS
 * 2. Transcode last characters of name
 *   2a. EE, IE          -&gt;   Y
